 in peripheral blood", "Autoimmune hematologic syndrome: Unlikely given the blast percentage and systemic constitutional symptoms", "Metabolic syndrome with secondary hematologic effects: No metabolic derangements in serum labs to support this"], "alarm_features": ["Weight loss (10 lbs/month)", "Night sweats", "Fever (100°F)", "Leukocytosis with blasts"]}, "branches": {"B1": {"id": "B1", "label": "Myeloid Neoplasm with Increased Blasts", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "expanded", "prior": 0.5247099625329061, "posterior": 0.48143652879399734, "danger": 0.8, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.5, "evidence_for": ["The subacute presentation with blasts favors blast crisis of chronic myeloproliferative diseases (B3) over de novo AML (B1), but this is contradicted by consti…"], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": ["B1.1", "B1.2", "B1.3"], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.5, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.7, "interrupt_relevance": 0.9, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "mechanism", "representative_diseases": ["acute myeloid leukemia", "myelodysplastic syndrome with excess blasts", "chronic myeloid leukemia in blast crisis"]}, "B2": {"id": "B2", "label": "Lymphoid Neoplasm with Increased Blasts", "level": 1, "status": "parked", "posterior": 0.019, "danger": 0.7, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": ["Lack of documented CML history and prominent constitutional symptoms strongly argue against CML in blast crisis (B1.2), as blast crisis typically occurs in pat…"]}, "B3": {"id": "B3", "label": "Chronic Myeloproliferative Neoplasm", "level": 1, "status": "closed_for_now", "posterior": 0.017, "danger": 0.6, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": ["Lack of documented CML history and prominent constitutional symptoms strongly argue against CML in blast crisis (B1.2), as blast crisis typically occurs in pat…"]}, "B4": {"id": "B4", "label": "Pl